<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wescast cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wescast cut on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Philip Fricke said he downgraded Wescast Industries Inc to hold from buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- said the company's fundamentals remained &quot;extremely strong.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said with sharp gains in past couple of days &quot;the stock ran ahead of the fundamentals a little bit.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set $39 12-month price target on the shares, which closed Monday at $37 in Nasdaq trading.</p>
</text>
